# Room dividers outside the center corridor
Solid {
  translation 0 -1.8 0.175
  children [ Shape { appearance PBRAppearance { baseColor 0.42 0.49 0.56 roughness 0.8 metalness 0 } geometry Box { size 0.10 2.4 0.35 } } ]
  name "south room divider"
  boundingObject Box { size 0.10 2.4 0.35 }
